        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "71cc479e-a29d-5737-9c21-55838ebe18db",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Aldrich Ames\n- Organizations: Central Intelligence Agency, KGB, Federal Bureau of Prisons, United States Department of Justice\n- Places: Terre Haute, Indiana, United States\n- Facilities: Federal Correctional Institution, Terre Haute; Terre Haute Federal Correctional Complex\n- Topics: espionage, imprisonment\n\nFacts:\n- Aldrich Ames was born on May 26, 1941.\n- Aldrich Ames is a former Central Intelligence Agency officer who became a KGB mole.\n- Aldrich Ames was convicted of espionage in 1994.\n- Aldrich Ames is serving a life sentence without parole at the Federal Correctional Institution, Terre Haute, in Indiana, United States.\n- The Federal Correctional Institution, Terre Haute is a medium-security United States federal prison for male inmates in Indiana.\n- The Federal Correctional Institution, Terre Haute is part of the Terre Haute Federal Correctional Complex.\n- The Federal Correctional Institution, Terre Haute is operated by the Federal Bureau of Prisons, which is a division of the United States Department of Justice.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
